      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng tlakweemakariya' iga ár baraá daanduú yaamuwo, nee muu ngwa al'iiloouyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú bar hee ngwaa daqaari'iimár i haniís nee ilaiwa/ame dír geeraá muko, nee gár kuwa /aár i káhh baraá hotaawose ar i slai, ala Mungú gu aleesleemuú i hanisiiká daqaari'iimadá' ngiwa /ayi, aqo heé xuaawásl gan /aay. Gaarí a tawór huwisha, nee a gár ló'wa slahh'eemiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes hee na/aá tsiiru gaa laqwaál, nee iri hoót kureeraá yaariire, iri hoót deelór yaariire, ala inós amohhooár hotaangw gaa slayká, nee iwa gwaá' kwaa fooliiká, aníng a kah, gurkwahhama a tsiní ta heewihe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma na/oó aa baraá gurií gwaa', tam kwa laqwaali gaarós i káhh, inós aqo kun kwaahh, kuri gunqarees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slám malé ale, na/oó adoorí gwa/aateemaá looa gaa ariiká, laqaá gár aa tsaáhh i káhh. Tam inós hungu/uma gi sláy ta heedaádá' taa fooliikahe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na/aywí a tsiní ta heedaádá' amohhooár koomakahe, tam aa hooti kureeri kume tsare. Xáy, inooín tsaraawo amór ta kay a wakekáhe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hee in gadiyuus as muruú /ayma nguwa slay, ala hee ilatleeriro i baloó hhe'eesiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xáy sagaloousmo a tsiníhe ta daktanto? Nee heé liitlakusmo gár i slay a milá? Tam adór hotaangw ngi xui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gár hhoo' alók an bu'út ar muruú ta koon ta tawa daawimita as ilatleerír muruú hatlá', gaarí a tawór huwisha, nee a adór heé fur'a gaa alta'aain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo gár tleehharuuta kana iimír aáng wa qoomeés, nee adór hee i dirii'i i xu'utít, nee adór inós tir tlaampa'aasiaaká nee kudá' úr dirose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axweesanoó yaariír a tawór huwisha, gár hee nguwa bui a milá? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma heé ga xuú' a heemá gár ganaa' dír heewo baraá slafiingós kwí ququmaare, oo gaa wásl, kwí waaraáhh adór mahhtí wa ale? Heé baraá yaamuwo ga xuú' a heemá gár hee gu slaw alaá gwa'araro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
